    {
      "statement": "PointGT presents a point-based 3D representation that enables simultaneous editing of object geometry and appearance.",
      "confidence": 0.95
    },
    {
      "statement": "P-CORE introduces a self-supervised method to adapt point-based representations to large deformations without requiring ground truth images.",
      "confidence": 0.95
    },
    {
      "statement": "Both methods demonstrate improved performance in zero-shot editing and reduced artifacts on synthetic benchmarks.",
